+## Format: `witness-bundle/2` (default)
 
-Bundles are written as newline-delimited JSON (one JSON object per line):
+Bundles are newline-delimited JSON: a header line, then one audit entry per line,
+exactly as the entry was written to the encrypted log.
 
-- **Line 1**: Bundle header (metadata, chain hash, optional signature)
